1) Run the Jar with:
java -jar Main.jar

2) You are going to be prompted for a seed, to get the same results as in our table use 867.

-For this next step make sure you have your knapsack instances in a folder that is in the same directory as the Main.jar.
3) And then you will be prompted for the directory path, just type the name of the folder (where all the knapsack Instances are).
